						],
						"pointId": 311400066
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 700501001,
					"content": "Huh? Where did Guijarro go? Wasn't she here just a moment ago?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501002,
						700501003
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501002,
					"content": "Guess she was kidnapped by a Xuanwen beast?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501004
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700501004,
					"content": "Hey, don't say stuff like that! She probably just ran off somewhere thinking about her plotline. Let's search the area.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501005
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501005,
					"content": "The tea field to the side gives us a good vantage point. Let's start from there.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501006
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700501006,
					"content": "Good idea! Let's start our search from up high!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501003,
					"content": "Did her novel turn out to be truer than fiction?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501004
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7005012,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7005012
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7005012",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7005012,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Guijarro"
				],
				"points": [
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							2304.876,
							292.814,
							1561.417
						],
						"pointId": 311400064
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 700501201,
					"content": "Guijarro! How did you get over here?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501202,
					"content": "...No, no. I can't have them find the key clue just like that. Also, can someone really still think well after being tied up here all night?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Guijarro"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501203,
					"content": "Wow, she's totally engrossed. Has she finally found a breakthrough?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501204,
					"content": "More like a real roadblock.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501205
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700501205,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}, Paimon, you've arrived just in time.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Guijarro"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501206,
					"content": "Could you tie me to a wooden stake?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Guijarro"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501207,
					"content": "D—Did Paimon hear that right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501208,
					"content": "Yep, that's exactly what I said. Please tie my hands, and string me up by them on a... tree. Um, well, they're all wood anyway, so it should make no difference.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Guijarro"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501209,
					"content": "I don't intend to become the suspect in your novel.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501210
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700501210,
					"content": "Oh, don't worry, I've already written up a liability document, which assigns responsibility for all mishaps that might occur to me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Guijarro"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501211,
					"content": "No, no, that's not the problem. Why do you want us to tie you up at all? You haven't done anything wrong...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501212,
					"content": "But the main character of my novel will be strung up by their hands by the villagers and left in the wild for a whole night, awaiting the Xuanwen beast's judgment.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Guijarro"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501213,
					"content": "Later in the plot, the main character, having expected this turn of events, will somehow survive, and endure the night, before revealing the truth behind everything...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Guijarro"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501214,
					"content": "...However, I have no clue how a person who has been tied up for a whole night would feel. Not how they'd sound, think, or even move!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Guijarro"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501215,
					"content": "That's why I need you two to tie me up and keep me here the whole night. That way, I'll be able to experience those feelings for myself.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501216,
						700501217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Guijarro"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501216,
					"content": "Nope. This is way too dangerous.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501218
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700501218,
					"content": "...Um. Well, there is, but it probably wouldn't be as effective.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Guijarro"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501219,
					"content": "Instead of that, I could... raise my hands up and stay here for the whole night.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Guijarro"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501220,
					"content": "Uhh... Or you could just not write that novel. Our actions here could be easily misunderstood...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501221,
					"content": "You're really putting your main character through the wringer...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501222
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700501222,
					"content": "Please! This is the most important step! Once I get over this hurdle, my novel will be complete! If we use this method, you won't have to commit any crimes...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Guijarro"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501223,
					"content": "Not that we ever had to!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501224,
					"content": "We never had to in the first place!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501225
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700501225,
					"content": "Ah... Well, I mean, you really don't have to do all that much. Just stand guard by my side so that I won't be dragged off by someone... or some animal, while I gather the information I need.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Guijarro"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501226,
					"content": "Let me see... Considering the atmosphere we're trying to create in the novel, we still need to go further up...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Guijarro"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501227,
					"content": "Huh? Hey! Wait for us!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501228,
					"content": "You and Guijarro climb to the highest point of the tea fields...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501229
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700501229,
					"content": "Whew, I—It's... kinda c—cold, but it... really gets you into the mood of things!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501230
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Guijarro"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501230,
					"content": "Are you really going to stand here the whole night with your hands upraised?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501231
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501231,
					"content": "That's right. I've decided to do this. Some sacrifices must be made for the sake of writing...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501232
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Guijarro"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501232,
					"content": "Well, please stand guard here in the meantime. Just one night... Just one night...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Guijarro"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501217,
					"content": "Isn't there a safer way to do this?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501218
					]
				}
			]
		},
